+             applied) is untouched - this is a visual correction only.
+             Real aircraft: QAV-R 2, motors at 0.151 m, 7 in props
+             (0.0889 m radius) -> 0.240 m swept,
+             which is what base_collision's r=0.240 cylinder already
+             models. The Iris mesh drew motors at 0.2555 m with
+             0.1333 m blades = 0.389 m swept, so the
+             picture was 62% wider than the body that actually collides -
+             props visibly swept through walls the drone never touched. -->
